// The console system: joe-base and nothing else.
//
//   dave image build image/console.zon --test --repo joe,DIR,URL,KEY --out joe.img
//
// --test adds joe-test-console, which the automated tests need and no real
// installation should have: root is logged in on the serial console. The
// serial console needs no console= here: servers and QEMU's virt machine
// describe theirs to the kernel (ACPI SPCR).
.{
    .name = "joe-console",
    .packages = .{"joe-base"},
}
